@startuml Linkwise_Chat_Message_States
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Latin Modern Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam ArrowColor #2A9D8F
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 22
skinparam ranksep 28
title UML state machine: sender delivery knowledge (proposed)
[*] --> Queued : outbox committed
Queued --> Transferring : contact starts
Transferring --> AwaitingReceipt : bytes sent
Transferring --> Queued : retry eligible
AwaitingReceipt --> Queued : retry eligible
AwaitingReceipt --> RemoteReceived : inbox receipt
Queued --> RemoteReceived : late receipt
RemoteReceived --> AgentProcessed : processing receipt
Queued --> Expired : expired
AwaitingReceipt --> Expired : expired
Queued --> Cancelled : cancel
Transferring --> Cancelling : cancel
Cancelling --> Cancelled : stopped
Transferring --> Failed : budget exhausted
Queued --> Failed : rejected
note bottom of Cancelled
Cancelled/expired/failed stop local delivery work.
They do not prove the remote station has no copy.
Late receipts are retained as evidence without
restarting transmission.
AgentProcessed is optional and not an exactly-once
side-effect guarantee.
end note
@enduml
